<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Brume Cafe</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300..700;1,300..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        html{
            scroll-behavior:smooth;
        }


        *{
           margin:0px;
           padding:0px;
           box-sizing:border-box;
        }


        :root{
            --cream:#f7f3ee;
            --beige: #e8ddd1;
            --sand: #c9b99a;
            --brown: #7c5c3e;
            --dark: #2c1f14;
            --text: #4a3728;
            --light: #fdfaf7;
        }


        body{
            font-family:'DM sans',sans-serif;
            background:var(--cream);
            color:var(--text);
            overflow-x:hidden;
        }


        nav{
            position:fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index:100;
            display:flex;
            justify-content:space-between;
            align-items:center;
            padding:1.4rem 4rem;
            background:rgba(247,243,238,0.85);
            backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
            border-bottom:1px solid var(--beige);
        }


        .logo{
            font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",serif;
            font-size:1.6rem;
            font-weight:600;
            letter-spacing:0.08rem;
            color:var(--dark);
        }


        .logo span{
            color:var(--brown);
            font-style:italic;
        }


        .nav-links {
            display:flex;
            gap:2.5rem;
            list-style:none;

        }


        .nav-links a{
            text-decoration:none;
            font-size:0.82rem;
            letter-spacing:0.12rem;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            font-weight:500;
            color:var(--text);
            transition:color 0.3s; 
        }


        .nav-btn {
            background: var(--brown);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
            white-space:nowrap;
        }


        .nav-btn:hover { background: var(--dark); }

        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--brown); }


        .hero{
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            padding-top: 80px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

         
         .hero-left{
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            justify-content:center;
            padding:5rem 3rem 5rem 5rem;
        }

        .hero h1{
            font-family:'cormorant garamond',serif;
            font-size:5rem;
            font-weight:300;
            line-height:1.08;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom:1.8rem;
        }

        .hero h1 em{
            font-style:italic;
            color:var(--brown);
        }


        .hero-tag{
            font-size:0.75rem;
            letter-spacing:0.2rem;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--sand);
            margin-bottom:1.5rem;
        }


        .hero p{
            font-size:1rem;
            line-height:1.8;
            opacity:0.8;
            max-width:400px;
            margin-bottom:2.5rem;
        }


        .hero-btns{
            display:flex;
            gap:1rem;
        }


        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--brown);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s;
            white-space:nowrap;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover{
            background: var(--dark);
        }


        .btn-outline{
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--brown);
            padding: 0.9rem 2rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--sand);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            cursor: pointer;
        }


        .btn-outline:hover{
            background: var(--beige);
        }


        .hero-right{
            background:var(--beige);
            position:relative;
            overflow:hidden;
            display:flex;
            align-items:center;
            justify-content:center;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
            50% {transform:translateY(-12px);}
        }

        .float-anim{
            animation:float;
            animation-duration:4s;
            animation-timing-function:ease-in-out;
            animation-iteration-count:infinite;
        }


        .marquee-wrap{
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--beige);
            padding: 0.9rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }


        .marquee-track{
            display:flex;
            animation: marquee 18s linear infinite;
            white-space:nowrap;
        }

        .marquee-item{
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0 2.5rem;
        }


        @keyframes marquee {
            from { transform: translateX(0); }
            to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
        }

        .menu{
            padding:6rem 5rem;
            background:var(--light);
        }


        .menu-header{
            text-align:center;
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }


        .menu-header h2 em{
            font-style:italic;
            color:var(--brown);
        }


        .menu-header p{
            margin-top:0.8rem;
            opacity:0.65;
            font-size:0.9rem;
        }


        .section-tag{
            font-size:0.72rem;
            letter-spacing:0.2rem;
            text-transform:uppercase;
            color:var(--sand);
            margin-bottom:1rem;
        }


        .menu-grid{
            display:grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
            gap:2rem;

        }


        .menu-card{
            background:white;
            padding:2rem;
            border:1px solid var(--beige);
            transition:transform 0.3s , box-shadow  0.3s;
            cursor:pointer;
        }


        .menu-card:hover{
            transform:translateY(-6px);
        }


        .menu-icon{
            font-size:2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }


        .menu-card h3{
            font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }


        .price{
            font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--brown);
            font-weight: 600;
        }


        .cta{
            margin-top:1.5rem;
            padding: 6rem 5rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: var(--cream);
        }


        .cta h2{
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--dark);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        
        .cta h2 em{
            color: var(--brown);
            font-style: italic;
        }


        .cta p{
            opacity: 0.65;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }


        .cta-row{
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }  
        
        
        .testimonial{
            padding:6rem 5rem;
            text-align:center;
            background:var(--beige);
        }


        .testimonial blockquote{
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: var(--dark);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }


        .stars{ 
            color: var(--brown);
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }


        cite{font-size: 0.78rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--brown);
            font-style: normal;
        }


        footer{
            margin-top:3rem;
            width:100%;
            background: var(--dark);
            color: var(--beige);
            padding: 3rem 5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .footer-links{
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem
        }


        .footer-links a{ 
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--sand);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover{color: var(--beige);}

        .footer-copy{
            font-size:0.75rem;
            opacity:0.4;
        }


        footer .logo {
            color: var(--beige);
        }


        footer .logo span {
            color: var(--sand);
        } 
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Brume<span>.</span></div>
                <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#">Story</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Menu</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Experience</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Visit</a></li>
            </ul>
        <button class="nav-btn">Reserve a Table</button>
        </nav>


        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-left">Est. 2005 . Artisian Coffee
                <h1>Where every cup tells a <br/><em>quiet story. </em></h1>
                <p>A sanctuary of slow mornings, handcrafted brews, and the warm hush of a place that feels like home.</p>
                <div class="hero-btns">
                        <button class="btn-primary">Explore Menu</button>
                        <button class="btn-outline">Our Story</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-right">
            <svg width="300" height="300" viewBox="0 0 300 300" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <ellipse cx="150" cy="230" rx="90" ry="14" fill="#c9b99a" opacity="0.5"/>
                <path d="M90 160 Q88 230 150 235 Q212 230 210 160 Z" fill="#f7f3ee" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <ellipse cx="150" cy="160" rx="60" ry="12" fill="#e8ddd1" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <ellipse cx="150" cy="160" rx="53" ry="10" fill="#7c5c3e" opacity="0.85"/>
                <path d="M130 158 Q150 148 170 158" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" opacity="0.7"/>
                <path d="M210 175 Q240 175 238 200 Q236 222 210 220" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M130 145 Q125 130 130 115 Q135 100 130 85" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" opacity="0.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M150 142 Q145 127 150 112 Q155 97 150 82" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" opacity="0.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M170 145 Q165 130 170 115 Q175 100 170 85" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" opacity="0.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <ellipse cx="150" cy="240" rx="78" ry="10" fill="#e8ddd1" stroke="#c9b99a" stroke-width="1"/>
            </svg>
            </div>
        </section>


        <div class="marquee-wrap">
            <div class="marquee-track">
                <span class="marquee-item">Artisian Coffee · Fresh Pasteries · Single Origin Beans · Handcrafted Blends · Slow Mornings · Good Vibes ·</span>
                <span class="marquee-item">Artisan Coffee · Fresh Pastries · Single Origin Beans · Handcrafted Blends · Slow Mornings · Good Vibes ·</span>
            </div>
            </div>


        <section class="menu" id="menu">
    <div class="menu-header">
        <div class="section-tag">What We Serve</div>
        <h2>A menu built on <em>simplicity.</em></h2>
        <p>Crafted drinks, fresh bakes, and seasonal specials — made every morning.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-grid">

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">☕</div>
            <h3>Signature Brume Latte</h3>
            <p>Our most loved cup, crafted with double shot espresso and oat milk.</p>
            <div class="price">₹280</div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">🫧</div>
            <h3>Honey Mist Cappuccino</h3>
            <p>Rich espresso crowned with a golden drizzle of wildflower honey.</p>
            <div class="price">₹260</div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">🌿</div>
            <h3>Cold Brew Tonic</h3>
            <p>18-hour steeped cold brew with sparkling tonic — refreshingly bold.</p>
            <div class="price">₹320</div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">🥐</div>
            <h3>Butter Croissant</h3>
            <p>Flaky, golden-baked every morning with real butter.</p>
            <div class="price">₹180</div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">🍋</div>
            <h3>Yuzu Matcha</h3>
            <p>Ceremonial grade matcha with citrusy yuzu and almond milk. Calm in a cup.</p>
            <div class="price">₹300</div>
        </div>

        <div class="menu-card">
            <div class="menu-icon">🫐</div>
            <h3>Blueberry Almond Cake</h3>
            <p>Moist almond sponge with wild blueberry compote and mascarpone cream.</p>
            <div class="price">₹220</div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

    <section class="testimonial">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote>"Brume is the only café I've been to that made me put my phone away. The latte, the silence, the light — everything is just right."</blockquote>
        <cite>Ananya R., Regular Guest</cite>
    </section>
    
    <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <div class="section-tag">Visit Us</div>
        <h2>Come for the Coffee,<br/> <em>stay for the calm. </em></h2>
            <p>Open daily · 7:30 AM - 9:00 PM · Koregaon Park, Pune</p>
                <div class="cta-row">
                    <button class="btn-primary">Reserve a Table</button>
                    <button class="btn-outline">Get Direction</button>
                </div>
    </section>

            <footer>
                <div class="logo">Brume<span>.</span></div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <a href="#">Instagram</a>
                    <a href="#">Menu</a>
                    <a href="#">Reserve</a>
                    <a href="#">Contact</a>
                </div>
                 <div class="footer-copy">© 2026 Brume Café. All rights reserved.</div>
            </footer>
</body>
</html>
